+## Task 2: DSC 多基线/边界重积分 v1
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `polynexus/core/dsc_engine/core.py`
+- Modify: `polynexus/core/analysis_evidence.py`
+- Test: `tests/test_dsc_engine.py`
